        },
        {
          "en": 1.6,
          "texto": {
            "es": "SU LUZ SE APAGÓ",
            "en": "HER LIGHT GREW DIM"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 200,
          "hasta": 3
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "Then the mother began to move to and fro.",
          "es": "Entonces la madre empezó a ir y venir."
        },
        {
          "en": "She saw that something was lacking, because the brightness of her light grew dim.",
          "es": "Vio que algo le faltaba, porque el brillo de su luz se apagaba."
        },
        {
          "en": "And she became dark, because her partner had not agreed with her.",
          "es": "Y se volvió oscura, porque su pareja no había estado de acuerdo con ella."
        },
        {
          "en": "For the first ruler had taken a great power from her.",
          "es": "Porque el primer gobernante le había quitado un gran poder."
        }
      ]
    },
